Renderer with the Python runtime and libraries it is packaged with, and,
in the Revelis VST 3 companion, interfaces of the Steinberg VST 3 SDK. VST
is a registered trademark of Steinberg Media Technologies GmbH.

THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt in the installation folder lists every component
with its version, license, copyright notice and project address; the
license texts are installed with it. The installer uses the Inter and
Cormorant Garamond typefaces under the SIL Open Font License 1.1. Nothing
in this agreement limits the rights those licenses grant for their
components.

FFmpeg (an LGPL build), c2patool and the C2PA trust list are downloaded on
your computer from their publishers and are licensed to you by them, not
by Arctisoft Studio.

